<!DOCTYPE html><html  lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>AI workflow library — Workflows, agents, orchestration, and practical guides | StackOS</title><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_vuom49.png"><meta name="twitter:image:src" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_vuom49.png"><meta property="og:image" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/_og/s/o_vuom49.png"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="600"><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="600"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/entry.z7ALz4wj.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/index.CNbJ2d9T.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/useIntegrationCatalog.wtjwSlpy.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/CatalogCard.CZo9PXiI.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/ArticleCard.ELpExItc.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/GeneratedVisual.Cf-hdjOs.css" crossorigin><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_nuxt/LibraryFrame.CD2pOTex.css" crossorigin><link rel="preload" href="/fonts/manrope-latin-variable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="preload" as="fetch" crossorigin="anonymous" href="/library/_payload.json?aa8e47a4-cf64-43ed-8aa2-6473b185d6eb"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/BT73oLzS.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DdI-7K8C.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/D6cldFGh.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/8-IjujsF.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/kaC1AgXW.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/LP-lSYvf.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/Dbua9CwJ.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DIYlYVLR.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/B6FA65gX.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/DwqMvcOE.js"><link rel="modulepreload" as="script" crossorigin href="/_nuxt/CBNv9QJs.js"><script type="module" src="/_nuxt/BT73oLzS.js" crossorigin></script><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/images/stackos-icon.png"><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="StackOS Library" href="/feed.xml"><meta name="description" content="Explore StackOS workflows, specialist agents, orchestrators, integrations, and practical guides grounded in visible state, evidence, and verification."><meta name="theme-color" content="#090b10"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="AI workflow library — Workflows, agents, orchestration, and practical guides | StackOS"><meta property="og:description" content="Explore StackOS workflows, specialist agents, orchestrators, integrations, and practical guides grounded in visible state, evidence, and verification."><meta name="twitter:title" content="AI workflow library — Workflows, agents, orchestration, and practical guides | StackOS"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Explore StackOS workflows, specialist agents, orchestrators, integrations, and practical guides grounded in visible state, evidence, and verification."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/library/"><meta property="og:url" content="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/library/"><script type="application/ld+json" data-hid="library-faq">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is in the StackOS AI workflow library?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The StackOS Library documents complete agentic workflows, the focused AI agents inside them, the orchestrators that coordinate each job, and practical implementation guides."}}]}</script><meta property="og:site_name" content="StackOS"><script id="unhead:payload" type="application/json">{"titleTemplate":"%s | StackOS"}</script></head><body><div id="__nuxt"><!--[--><div id="top" class="site library-site" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-e230b581><a class="skip-link" href="#main" data-v-e230b581>Skip to content</a><header class="site-header" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell site-header__inner"><a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="StackOS home"><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="36" height="36"><span>StackOS</span><small>Work, organized</small></a><nav class="site-nav site-nav--desktop" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a aria-current="page" href="/library/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav><details class="mobile-menu"><summary role="button" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-controls="site-navigation"><span></span><span></span></summary><nav id="site-navigation" class="site-nav site-nav--mobile" aria-label="Primary"><a href="/#why" class="">Why StackOS</a><a href="/#workflow" class="">Workflows</a><a href="/#proof" class="">Product</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="">Get started</a><a aria-current="page" href="/library/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active">Library</a><a href="/#security" class="">Security</a><a class="button button--header" href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac"><img class="button__logo button__logo--apple" src="/images/apple.webp" alt="" width="18" height="18"> Download for Mac <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></nav></details></div></header><div class="library-nav" aria-label="Library sections" data-v-e230b581><div class="shell library-nav__inner" data-v-e230b581><a aria-current="page" href="/library/" class="router-link-active is-active" data-v-e230b581>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Workflows</a><a href="/library/agents/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Agents</a><a href="/library/orchestrators/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Orchestrators</a><a href="/library/integrations/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Integrations</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-e230b581>Articles</a></div></div><main id="main" class="library-main" data-v-e230b581><nav class="library-breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-v-e230b581 data-v-59391fa3><div class="shell" data-v-59391fa3><ol data-v-59391fa3><!--[--><li data-v-59391fa3><a href="/" class="" data-v-59391fa3>Home</a></li><li data-v-59391fa3><a aria-current="page" href="/library/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-59391fa3>Library</a></li><!--]--></ol></div></nav><!--[--><section class="library-hero" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="shell library-hero__grid" data-v-7a8df37d><div data-v-7a8df37d><p class="library-kicker" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="status-dot" data-v-7a8df37d></span> The work behind the product</p><h1 data-v-7a8df37d>See how AI work <em data-v-7a8df37d>actually gets done.</em></h1><p class="library-hero__lede" data-v-7a8df37d> Find a practical guide, connect a tool, or choose a workflow for your next task. Each workflow also shows the specialist agents and orchestration behind the work. </p></div><div class="library-hero__visual" aria-label="Library contents" data-v-7a8df37d><a href="/library/workflows/" class="library-stat" data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>36</strong><span data-v-7a8df37d>Complete workflows</span></a><a href="/library/agents/" class="library-stat" data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>52</strong><span data-v-7a8df37d>Specialist agents</span></a><a href="/library/orchestrators/" class="library-stat" data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>5</strong><span data-v-7a8df37d>Coordinators</span></a><a href="/library/articles/" class="library-stat" data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>4+</strong><span data-v-7a8df37d>Practical guides</span></a></div></div></section><section class="library-map" aria-labelledby="library-map-title" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="shell library-map__grid" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="library-map__intro" data-v-7a8df37d><p class="eyebrow" data-v-7a8df37d>Choose a starting point</p><h2 id="library-map-title" data-v-7a8df37d>What do you want <em data-v-7a8df37d>to do next?</em></h2><p data-v-7a8df37d>Use a guide to learn the method, an integration page to connect a tool, or a workflow to see what a task needs and produces.</p></div><div class="library-map__links" data-v-7a8df37d><a href="/library/articles/use-codex-claude-gemini-with-existing-tools/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span data-v-7a8df37d>01 / Learn</span><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Use your existing AI client.</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>Follow the client setup guide →</small></a><a href="/library/integrations/google-search-console/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span data-v-7a8df37d>02 / Connect</span><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Read your site&#39;s search performance.</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>Set up Search Console →</small></a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span data-v-7a8df37d>03 / Start</span><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Choose a workflow for your task.</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>Compare the inputs and outputs →</small></a></div></div></section><section class="library-integrations" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="shell library-integrations__grid" data-v-7a8df37d><div data-v-7a8df37d><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7a8df37d>Use the stack you already have</p><h2 data-v-7a8df37d>The tools stay. <em data-v-7a8df37d>The work gets organized.</em></h2><p data-v-7a8df37d>Browse 59 providers and 740 supported actions across communication, publishing, SEO, commerce, advertising, research, media, and more.</p><a href="/library/integrations/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d>Explore every integration →</a></div><div class="library-integrations__providers" data-v-7a8df37d><!--[--><a href="/library/integrations/google-search-console/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#79dfff;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/google-search-console.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Google Search Console</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>7 actions</small></span></a><a href="/library/integrations/openai-images/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#9aa7bd;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/openai.webp" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>OpenAI Images</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>2 actions</small></span></a><a href="/library/integrations/shopify/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#95bf47;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/shopify-icon.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Shopify Admin API</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>58 actions</small></span></a><a href="/library/integrations/slack-bot/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#7ee2ad;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/slack-icon.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Slack Bot</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>10 actions</small></span></a><a href="/library/integrations/trackbooth/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo is-wordmark" style="--mark-color:#d9ff63;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/trackbooth.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>Trackbooth</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>337 actions</small></span></a><a href="/library/integrations/wordpress/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#b99cff;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/wordpress-icon.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-7a8df37d><strong data-v-7a8df37d>WordPress</strong><small data-v-7a8df37d>1 actions</small></span></a><!--]--></div></div></section><section class="library-section library-section--ink" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="shell" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-7a8df37d><div data-v-7a8df37d><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7a8df37d>Ready-made paths</p><h2 data-v-7a8df37d>Start with a complete workflow.</h2></div><div data-v-7a8df37d><p data-v-7a8df37d>See the stages, specialist roles, tool boundaries, evidence requirements, recovery paths, and completion checks for work across engineering, content, sales, support, SEO, and paid media.</p><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d>Explore all workflows →</a></div></div><div class="library-grid" data-v-7a8df37d><!--[--><a href="/library/workflows/branding-brand-foundation-setup/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#d8ff63;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>branding</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Brand Foundation Setup</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A current brand profile and durable voice guide that future agents can retrieve, apply, test, and update without guessing.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>6 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/branding-content-production/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#d8ff63;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>branding</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Branding Content Production</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A reviewed, evidence-backed piece in the project voice, with channel versions and publication governed by the request&#39;s explicit execution intent.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>10 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/communications-customer-feedback-intake/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#7ee2ad;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>communications</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Customer Feedback Intake</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>One route-approved Slack thread containing the complete feedback packet and safe refs for investigation.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>4 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/engineering-tracked-delivery/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#7892ff;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>engineering</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Engineering Tracked Delivery</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A change checked against the original request, with test results, independent review and a recorded release status. The record shows what was completed and what still needs attention.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>12 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/finance-bookkeeping-close/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Bookkeeping Preparation and Reconciliation</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A reviewed, externally recorded close packet marked prepared/unposted, with matched and exception refs that can be handed to later workflows.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>5 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/workflows/finance-cashflow-management/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><i data-v-661e3dea></i><span data-v-661e3dea></span><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>workflow</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Cashflow Management</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>A dated external thirteen-week forecast packet with safe evidence/proof refs, uncertainty, exception state, and tax-estimate handoff readiness.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>4 stages</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><!--]--></div></div></section><section class="library-section" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="shell" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-7a8df37d><div data-v-7a8df37d><p class="eyebrow" data-v-7a8df37d>From the work</p><h2 data-v-7a8df37d>Practice, evidence, and direct answers.</h2></div><div data-v-7a8df37d><p data-v-7a8df37d>Read setup guides, worked methods, and accounts of the decisions and checks behind agent work.</p><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d>Read all articles →</a></div></div><div class="article-grid" data-v-7a8df37d><!--[--><a href="/library/articles/ai-workflow-automation/" class="article-card" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-b4c14f53><!----><div class="article-card__meta" data-v-b4c14f53><span data-v-b4c14f53>AI operations</span><span data-v-b4c14f53>5 min read</span></div><h3 data-v-b4c14f53>AI workflow automation: automate the rules, not the judgment</h3><p data-v-b4c14f53>Decide which workflow checks belong in code, which need an agent to interpret evidence, and when a person must supply missing intent or permission.</p><b data-v-b4c14f53>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-b4c14f53>→</span></b></a><a href="/library/articles/how-ai-orchestrators-triage-feedback/" class="article-card" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-b4c14f53><!----><div class="article-card__meta" data-v-b4c14f53><span data-v-b4c14f53>AI operations</span><span data-v-b4c14f53>6 min read</span></div><h3 data-v-b4c14f53>How should an AI orchestrator triage feedback?</h3><p data-v-b4c14f53>Work through a mixed review queue to decide which findings need a repair, who should make it, and what to check before calling the work complete.</p><b data-v-b4c14f53>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-b4c14f53>→</span></b></a><a href="/library/articles/how-to-refine-ai-agent-workflow/" class="article-card" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-b4c14f53><div class="generated-visual generated-visual--workflow is-compact" style="--visual-color:#d9ff63;" role="img" aria-label="A complete plan you can follow. AI operations. From request to result." data-v-b4c14f53 data-v-9361e887><header class="generated-visual__header" data-v-9361e887><div data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887>From request to result</span><strong data-v-9361e887>A complete plan you can follow.</strong></div><small data-v-9361e887>Visible plan</small></header><div class="generated-visual__lane" aria-hidden="true" data-v-9361e887><div class="visual-node visual-node--clients" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Start in your AI</span><div class="client-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/openai.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Codex</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Claude</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/gemini.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Gemini</b></span><!--]--></div></di