visual-node visual-node--clients" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Start in your AI</span><div class="client-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/openai.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Codex</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/claude.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Claude</b></span><span class="client-chip" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/gemini.webp" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>Gemini</b></span><!--]--></div></div><i class="visual-connector" data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887></span></i><div class="visual-node visual-node--stackos" data-v-9361e887><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt="" width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-9361e887><strong data-v-9361e887>StackOS</strong><small data-v-9361e887>Builds the plan</small></div><i class="visual-connector" data-v-9361e887><span data-v-9361e887></span></i><div class="visual-node visual-node--outcome" data-v-9361e887><span class="visual-node__label" data-v-9361e887>Visible stages</span><div class="outcome-list" data-v-9361e887><!--[--><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>1</b> Plan</span><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>2</b> Do</span><span data-v-9361e887><b data-v-9361e887>3</b> Check</span><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="article-card__meta" data-v-b4c14f53><span data-v-b4c14f53>AI operations</span><span data-v-b4c14f53>9 min read</span></div><h3 data-v-b4c14f53>What should an AI agent handoff include?</h3><p data-v-b4c14f53>Build an AI agent handoff with the objective, evidence, context, tools, expected result, and stopping rule. See how to continue after an interrupted update.</p><b data-v-b4c14f53>Read the guide <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-b4c14f53>→</span></b></a><!--]--></div></div></section><section class="library-section library-section--deep" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="shell" data-v-7a8df37d><div class="library-section__heading" data-v-7a8df37d><div data-v-7a8df37d><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--dark" data-v-7a8df37d>Focused responsibilities</p><h2 data-v-7a8df37d>The right specialist at the right stage.</h2></div><div data-v-7a8df37d><p data-v-7a8df37d>Agents research, create, review, and verify. Orchestrators choose the next valid step and gate feedback against the accepted plan.</p><a href="/library/agents/" class="" data-v-7a8df37d>Meet every agent →</a></div></div><div class="library-grid" data-v-7a8df37d><!--[--><a href="/library/agents/branding-profile-architect/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#d8ff63;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span class="catalog-card__agent" data-v-661e3dea>A</span><i class="catalog-card__orbit" data-v-661e3dea></i><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>agent</span><b data-v-661e3dea>branding</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Brand Profile Architect</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>Builds and maintains evidence-led brand profiles and durable voice guides from operator judgment, representative samples, and independent review.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>Profile Architect</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/agents/branding-channel-strategist/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#d8ff63;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span class="catalog-card__agent" data-v-661e3dea>A</span><i class="catalog-card__orbit" data-v-661e3dea></i><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>agent</span><b data-v-661e3dea>branding</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Branding Channel Strategist</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>Owns angle, structure, and channel publication job decisions without executing publication.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>Channel Strategist</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/agents/branding-claim-auditor/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#d8ff63;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span class="catalog-card__agent" data-v-661e3dea>A</span><i class="catalog-card__orbit" data-v-661e3dea></i><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>agent</span><b data-v-661e3dea>branding</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Branding Claim Auditor</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>Read-only adversarial reviewer that enforces evidence-over-assertion.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>Claim Auditor</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><!--]--></div><div class="library-grid" style="margin-top:17px;" data-v-7a8df37d><!--[--><a href="/library/orchestrators/branding-brand-orchestrator/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#d8ff63;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span class="catalog-card__hub" data-v-661e3dea>O</span><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--one" data-v-661e3dea></i><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--two" data-v-661e3dea></i><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--three" data-v-661e3dea></i><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>orchestrator</span><b data-v-661e3dea>branding</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Brand Orchestrator</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>Main-agent operating loop for evidence-led brand-foundation setup and voice-consistent content production, review, and optional publication.</p><div class="catalog-ca