egated delivery and immediate independent review, and accepting verified integrated work.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>1 workflows</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/orchestrators/stackos-finance-department-orchestrator/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span class="catalog-card__hub" data-v-661e3dea>O</span><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--one" data-v-661e3dea></i><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--two" data-v-661e3dea></i><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--three" data-v-661e3dea></i><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>orchestrator</span><b data-v-661e3dea>finance</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Finance Department Orchestrator</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>Main-agent guidance for a six-workflow finance department that keeps all finance facts external while coordinating bounded agents, provider actions, received-payment settlement approvals,…</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>6 workflows</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><a href="/library/orchestrators/stackos-workflow-orchestrator/" class="catalog-card" style="--card-color:#8ea6ff;" data-v-7a8df37d data-v-661e3dea><div class="catalog-card__visual" aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea><!--[--><span class="catalog-card__hub" data-v-661e3dea>O</span><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--one" data-v-661e3dea></i><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--two" data-v-661e3dea></i><i class="catalog-card__branch catalog-card__branch--three" data-v-661e3dea></i><!--]--></div><div class="catalog-card__meta" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>orchestrator</span><b data-v-661e3dea>core</b></div><h3 data-v-661e3dea>Workflow Orchestrator</h3><p data-v-661e3dea>Main-agent operating loop for workflows that do not need a domain-specific orchestrator.</p><div class="catalog-card__footer" data-v-661e3dea><span data-v-661e3dea>23 workflows</span><b aria-hidden="true" data-v-661e3dea>↗</b></div></a><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></main><footer class="site-footer" data-v-e230b581 data-v-5f58f905><div class="shell site-footer__grid" data-v-5f58f905><a href="/" class="footer-brand" data-v-5f58f905><img src="/images/stackos-icon.png" alt width="42" height="42" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>StackOS</strong><span data-v-5f58f905>Keep AI-powered work clear, connected, and moving.</span></div></a><div class="site-footer__links" data-v-5f58f905><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Explore</span><a href="/#why" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Why StackOS</a><a href="/getting-started/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Getting started</a><a aria-current="page" href="/library/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active" data-v-5f58f905>Library</a><a href="/library/workflows/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Workflows</a><a href="/library/articles/" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Articles</a></div><div data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>Build</span><a href="/#security" class="" data-v-5f58f905>Security</a><a href="https://stackos.flowmonkey.io/StackOS/stackos-latest-mac-arm64.dmg" data-download="stackos-mac" data-v-5f58f905>Download</a><a href="https://github.com/flowmonkeyio/StackOS" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-v-5f58f905>GitHub ↗</a></div></div><div class="site-footer__status" data-v-5f58f905><span class="status-dot" data-v-5f58f905></span><div data-v-5f58f905><strong data-v-5f58f905>Runs on your Mac</strong><small data-v-5f58f905>Your work. Your apps. Your private logins.</small></div></div></div><div class="shell site-footer__bottom" data-v-5f58f905><span data-v-5f58f905>StackOS · Your AI tool works. StackOS keeps the work organized.</span><s